{
  "slug": "sap-migrate",
  "name": "Sap Migrate",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "S/4HANA custom-code migration engine: run a brownfield conversion as a tracked campaign — inventory custom (Z/Y) objects, flag unused code for decommission, run the S/4HANA-readiness ATC, triage findings, and remediate mechanical changes at scale on a sandbox. Companion to sap-dev-core (install that first).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `sap-cc-analyze` (Runs the S/4HANA-readiness ATC over a migration campaign's REMEDIATE objects and captures per-finding results into findings/findings_raw.tsv, advancing each…), `sap-cc-campaign` (Owns the S/4HANA custom-code migration campaign workspace and is the orchestration entry point for the sap-migrate engine), `sap-cc-cloud-readiness` (Measures each custom (Z/Y) object's DISTANCE FROM ABAP CLOUD — the question S4HANA_READINESS (/sap-cc-analyze) does not answer), `sap-cc-decommission` (EXECUTES the retirement of unused custom objects a campaign flagged for decommission — turning \"40-60% of custom code…), `sap-cc-inventory` (Enumerates and classifies the custom (Z/Y / customer-namespace) repository objects in scope for an S/4HANA migration campaign), `sap-cc-remediate` (Remediates a migration campaign's TRIAGED R1 (mechanical) objects on the SANDBOX — the only sap-migrate skill that changes…), `sap-cc-triage` (Two modes for an S/4HANA migration campaign's readiness findings), `sap-cc-usage` (Overlays runtime usage data onto the campaign inventory to decide what to remediate vs), and 2 more\n- **Agents** (1): `cc-migration-engineer` (S/4HANA custom-code migration campaign orchestrator)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sap-migrate@claude-community` from `sapdev-ai/sap-dev` (`plugins/sap-migrate`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 10,
    "agent": 1
  },
